en it  comes to treat trends this year  well that's my favorite part of the  night so  i mean definitely sweets tables are  really in right now i think that people  like the idea of variety they want to  bring in  different suites that maybe mean  something to them whether maybe they  really enjoy going to a certain  cake shop or for a specific suite some  people are trying to bring in gelato  carts or something that's more  interactive like a donut wall or all of  the above so ending the night on  something sweet and even like a candy  bar that people can take with them is a  lot of fun oh i love that idea gelato  carts donut walls let's do all of it  thank you so much for your time and  expertise lisa we appreciate it
 

